  "details": "GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-base packages contain a collection of well-maintained base plug-ins.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gst-plugins-base: gst-plugins-base: Missing bounds checks in RTCP SDES packet parsing (CVE-2026-125712)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
